e binary predictors, nominal categorical levels, discrete feature_053 contrasts, and tested interactions around the major tracks are below threshold or null. feature_006, feature_014, and feature_017 are near zero in the core-zero background. The main unresolved issue is feature_063. In the core-zero background it produced a modest accepted residual association R213 with signed estimate +0.285 and lower bound +0.197, above threshold but far smaller than the major tracks and unvalidated. The registered overall and broader feature_063 contexts remain unresolved. The most informative next analysis is to evaluate H24 overall and H250-H253 broad feature_063 contexts, then, only if they remain meaningful, use interactions or additional conditioning to test whether feature_063 is an additional independent association track or a context-specific or correlated signal. Remaining active categorical and numeric screens are lower priority. All conclusions are associations in the supplied dataset only; they are not causal, biological, clinical, or generalizable claims.",
