alysis. The registered H321 test is best: feature_063=1 versus 0 among feature_027=1, within feature_010=0 and feature_037=0. A signed lower bound above +0.15 would broaden the conditional feature_063 residual beyond the feature_027=0 background. A below-threshold or invalid small-cell result would not prove absence; it would suggest context dependence, attenuation, or insufficient power. Without validation budget, this discovery-oriented internal follow-up is the most useful remaining step, together with cautious interpretation of any accepted result as an opaque-label association in this supplied dataset.",
